# Vendored front-end libraries: fetched once and committed, keep despite
# any broad rule above.
!src/mapgen/web/static/vendor/*

# Test fixtures, kept despite the survey data rules above, deliberately
# (task 39). tests/data/ holds two real OpenTopography DEMs unchanged and the
# recorded output of Urbano's own reader and grid builder on them. They are
# the standard mapgen.geotiff and mapgen.egrid are measured against, and a
# check that cannot be rerun from the repository is not a check. 80 KB in
# total; provenance and licence are in tests/data/README.md.
!tests/data/
!tests/data/*
